1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:06,356
Apne channel par 11 AI agents run karne se pehle, ye dekh lo ki 7 din me kya break hua.

2
00:00:06,456 --> 00:00:17,225
Maine 11 open-source AI agent skills test kiye jo YouTube channel ka scriptwriting, hook scoring, title packaging aur edit cutting automatically sambhalte hain.

3
00:00:17,325 --> 00:00:28,430
Aaj hum is poori video par in tools ko live test karenge, aur main aapko dikhaunga ki ye kahan ghanton ka time bachate hain aur kahan poori tarah fail ho jaate hain.

4
00:00:28,530 --> 00:00:36,001
Zyadatar creators pehle title likhte hain, fir Photoshop khol kar wahi same words thumbnail par daal dete hain.

5
00:00:36,101 --> 00:00:39,669
Isse click surface ka aadha space waste ho jaata hai.

6
00:00:39,769 --> 00:00:43,336
Ye package linter do important rules check karta hai.

7
00:00:43,436 --> 00:00:49,359
Ek mobile screen par character limit, aur doosra title aur thumbnail me duplicate words.

8
00:00:49,459 --> 00:00:53,901
Jab maine normal generic title try kiya, toh isne reject kar diya.

9
00:00:54,001 --> 00:01:03,558
Lekin jab humne likha: *"11 AI Agents Ran My Entire Channel"* aur thumbnail par text diya *"ZERO HUMANS?"*—toh iska score aaya 100 out of 100.

10
00:01:03,658 --> 00:01:08,033
Ye rule force karta hai ki thumbnail wo bole jo title nahi bolta.

11
00:01:08,133 --> 00:01:10,355
Doosra tool hai hookscore dot py.

12
00:01:10,455 --> 00:01:13,147
Log sochte hain hook bas tukka hota hai.

13
00:01:13,247 --> 00:01:18,564
Ye script aapke pehle 15 seconds ko 5 alag-alag parameters par score karti hai.

14
00:01:18,664 --> 00:01:25,395
Agar main simple line likhun ki *"Maine AI ko channel ka control diya"*, toh score aata hai 41 WEAK.

15
00:01:25,495 --> 00:01:29,668
Kyunki isme curiosity low hai aur viewer ko address nahi kiya.

16
00:01:29,768 --> 00:01:41,008
Lekin jab humne hook change kiya: *"Apne channel par 11 AI agents run karne se pehle, ye dekh lo ki 7 din me kya break hua"*, toh score jump ho kar 74 STRONG ban gaya.

17
00:01:41,108 --> 00:01:45,415
Ye tool camera on karne se pehle hi weak hook ko pakad leta hai.

18
00:01:45,515 --> 00:01:49,756
Teesra pain point hai editing me dead air aur pauses cut karna.

19
00:01:49,856 --> 00:02:00,490
Ye tool transcript file ko scan karta hai aur jahan bhi 800 millisecond se zyada ka pause ya retake hota hai, uski ek automated cut list bana kar de deta hai.

20
00:02:00,590 --> 00:02:05,369
Is file ko aap seedha Premiere ya DaVinci Resolve me drop kar sakte ho.

21
00:02:05,469 --> 00:02:08,498
Manual timeline scrub karne ki zaroorat nahi.

22
00:02:08,598 --> 00:02:10,819
Lekin yahan sabse bada catch hai.

23
00:02:10,919 --> 00:02:14,486
Ye agents channel ko 100% automated nahi chala sakte.

24
00:02:14,586 --> 00:02:21,115
Agar aap inko strict voice profile nahi doge, toh ye wahi fake AI buzzwords repeat karne lagenge.

25
00:02:21,215 --> 00:02:23,167
Human review hamesha chahiye.

26
00:02:23,267 --> 00:02:27,440
Skills script likhengi, upload aur review aapko hi karna hoga.

27
00:02:27,540 --> 00:02:32,184
Ye saari 11 skills aur python scripts 100% free aur open-source hain.

28
00:02:32,284 --> 00:02:35,515
Koi paid API key ya signup ki zaroorat nahi hai.

29
00:02:35,615 --> 00:02:38,576
GitHub link niche description me pinned hai.

30
00:02:38,676 --> 00:02:44,128
Repo clone karo, apne agle video ka hook test karo, aur dekho kya score aata hai.

31
00:02:44,228 --> 00:02:45,497
Video pasand aayi toh channel ko subscribe zaroor karna.
